codePointCount()

Description: The codePointCount method returns the number of Unicode code points in the specified range of a string.

Program:

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s = "Hello";

        int count = s.codePointCount(0, s.length());

        System.out.println("Code Point Count: " + count);
    }
}

